<title>NETHERLANDS: CSM buys bakery ingredient maker Karp's.</title>
<headline>CSM buys bakery ingredient maker Karp's.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food group CSM NV said on Monday it had agreed to buy U.S. bakery ingredients maker Karp's Inc.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed, but CSM said it was paying entirely in cash.  </p>
<p>Karp's turnover is about $190 million (340 million guilders) and the firm is profitable. It employs 720 staff.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
